# OpenGL Persistent Buffer Mapping - Complete Guide

## Overview
High-performance OpenGL demo showcasing **zero-copy vertex streaming** using persistent mapped buffers with explicit GPU synchronization. This is a corrected, compilable version of broken sample code.

