## Technical Architecture

### Ring Buffer Layout
```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Buffer Storage (240,000 bytes)         │
├──────────────┬──────────────┬────────────┤
│  Frame 0     │  Frame 1     │  Frame 2   │
│  80,000 B    │  80,000 B    │  80,000 B  │
│ (10K verts)  │ (10K verts)  │ (10K verts)│
└──────────────┴──────────────┴────────────┘
      ↑              ↑              ↑
    CPU writes   GPU renders    GPU idle
```

### Synchronization Flow
```
Frame N:
  1. waitForFrame(N)     ← Wait for fence from Frame N-3
  2. streamVertices()    ← Write new data
  3. draw()              ← Render & place new fence
  4. frameIndex++        ← Advance to next buffer
```

